          }
        }
      }
    },
    "囲碁のはじめての遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go: first steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このゲームの目的" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The goal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒と白が交互に石を置いて、陣地を取り合うゲームです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black and white take turns placing stones to claim territory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤上の自分の石と、自分だけが囲んだ地の合計が多い方が勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever has more stones plus territory only they surround wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回の番でやること" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What to do on your turn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "線が交わる交点をタップして、石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a point where lines cross to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "置いた石は動かせません。黒と白が交互に置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Placed stones don't move. Black and white alternate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "石のまわりのたて・よこの空点を「呼吸点」といいます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The empty points above, below and beside a stone are its \"liberties\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打てない場所" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where you can't play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自分の石の呼吸点が無くなる場所には打てません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't play where your stone would have no liberties."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ただし、その手で相手の石を取れるなら打てます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "But you can if that move captures an opponent stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コウ: 取り返すと同じ形がくり返す場所は、すぐには打ち返せません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ko: where recapturing would repeat the same shape, you can't play back right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスと勝ち負け" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Passing and winning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打つところが無くなったら「パス」。両者が続けてパスすると終局です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When there is nowhere left to play, pass. The game ends when both players pass in a row."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "白にはコミ 6.5 目が加算されます（置き石の対局は別の数え方です）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "White gets 6.5 points of komi (games with handicap stones are counted differently)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
